WEBVTT

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:07.820
Their meeting was a little miracle.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:13.450
The little miracle gave way
to a little happiness,

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:17.300
and that happiness spread, little by little.

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:24.070
What can I do to repay you?

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:56.460
Good morning.

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:58.650
Morning, Brother.

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:01.150
Were there any good shows on tonight?

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:02.510
Yeah, actually.

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:07.200
Why didn't you wake
me up, Hayami-oneechan?

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.720
I tried a lot!

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:09.900
Really?

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:11.240
Really.

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:14.510
What's wrong, Brother?

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:16.850
Brother?

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:19.220
Don't walk around the house like that.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:23.370
I don't care if Brother sees me like this...

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:25.500
I care!

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:26.700
You do, Sister?

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:34.280
If you keep being a brat,

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:36.570
I'll make it so you can't walk for three days!

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:39.440
Oh, what are you going to do?

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:44.640
You're friends! You shouldn't fight!

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:47.120
Huh?

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:49.210
Why are the two of you my sisters?

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:52.070
H-How awful...

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:54.750
You still don't accept us as sisters?

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:57.920
Just because our last names are different,

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:00.530
and we're not related by blood or the law...

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:05.530
Tacky!

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:07.700
As your mother, I'm so angry with you,

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:11.120
saying things like that and upsetting
your two little sisters!

00:03:11.930 --> 00:03:13.880
My girls...

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.190
Now tell them they're your little sisters!

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:17.410
Now!

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:24.930
<b>Eighth Hour: Magical Otoha</b>

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:28.590
What was that?

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:29.690
No!

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:31.720
I'll be late!

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:39.960
I'm sorry.

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:43.550
Otoha-chan... What's the hurry?

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:44.470
Did you see?

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:46.500
How do I respond to that?

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:48.940
It's important to keep to the basics.

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:50.720
Basics?

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:52.120
Takuma-kun, a lot of weird

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.550
things might happen from now on.

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.510
So make sure you point them out, okay?

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:58.380
See you later!

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:01.670
Oh, no! I'll be late!

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:02.820
Otoha?

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:11.600
Morning, Takuma-chan!

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:16.470
I see you aren't with your sisters today!

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:18.300
What's wrong, Takuma-chan?

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:19.740
I know!

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:21.900
Calling you that embarrasses you!

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:23.310
But, no!

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:25.410
To me, you've always been Takuma-chan...

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:28.310
For a long time now!

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:30.340
<i>So she's a childhood friend, huh?</i>

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:31.750
Brother!

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.790
How could you ditch us and go to school alone?

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:35.830
That's right!

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.930
You two look upset this morning.

00:04:38.930 --> 00:04:40.680
Listen to this, Hamaji-chan!

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:43.630
Brother said that we aren't his sisters!

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:43.630
I got worried when you ran out.

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.200
I'm sorry. There was a big shock.

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:46.530
Shock!

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:48.660
Let me go!

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:50.620
I belong over there!

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:52.900
What are you talking about, Maki?

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:54.990
Your character's always been on this side!

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:56.050
No!

00:04:56.050 --> 00:04:57.940
I'm not a background character!

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:04.600
Okay, I have a new friend for you today.

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:05.450
Come in.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:07.180
Could it be...

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.760
What?

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:18.930
I'm the transfer student, Tabata Yui.

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:24.870
I shall graciously allow you
to worship me, heart and soul!

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:28.170
Oh, it's Yui-chan...

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:29.110
You!

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:31.100
Are you complaining about my transfer debut—

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.040
I'm late! I'm late!

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:38.990
Hi!

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:43.340
So, I'm Otoha. I transferred here
from the spirit world.

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:44.890
Nice to meet you all!

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:48.350
So cute!

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:49.890
My bride!

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:54.170
So actually, Otoha-san is Hirose-kun's fiancée!

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:57.430
So you can sit on his lap, right?

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:59.990
You don't need a seat.

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:02.410
That's embarrassing!

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:07.550
Please take care of me,
for the rest of our lives.

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:09.310
Whoo! Whoo!

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:10.450
Way to go!

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:11.370
Be happy together!

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:12.750
I'm so jealous!

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:16.680
You look great together, Otoha-neesan.

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:18.000
Be happy!

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:19.420
I hate it!

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:20.490
But I'll allow it!

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:22.080
Thank you, teacher.

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:23.060
Classmates!

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:24.760
And sisters-in-law!

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.030
Thank you!

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:31.470
You need to point out how
bizarre this is, Takuma-kun.

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:35.440
Or this world will believe it's normal,

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:38.180
and keep going this way!

00:06:38.180 --> 00:06:39.920
What?!

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:46.850
You see, there are big problems
in the spirit world.

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:50.590
Their effects have made
this world really weird.

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:53.640
And if we don't do something,
it'll get even weirder.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:55.850
So someone needs to stop it.

00:06:55.850 --> 00:07:00.520
And only you, the Promised One, can do it!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.470
So please, believe...

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:04.340
And save the world!

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:07.290
<i>But I really don't know what I'm
supposed to be pointing out...</i>

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:14.740
Who's that?

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:17.320
It can't be... Otoha-chan?

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:19.150
Or Hotaru-chan?

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:29.290
Tacky, take a bath with Mommy.

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:34.500
You're a guy, Uncle. Why are you
undressing so sexily?!

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:36.430
That's it, Takuma-kun!

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.470
Otoha-chan!

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:39.900
Takuma-kun, look.

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:43.690
What you did just charged my energy.

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:46.380
We're a step closer to the real world!

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:48.990
Don't peek! Don't look!

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:53.350
Oh, my. I'm so sorry...

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:57.990
Good morning.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:00.310
Look at that, Hirose-kun.

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:01.360
What's wrong?

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:05.030
<i>Th-This is...</i>

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.670
What?

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:15.890
The school's a farm now?

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:18.010
That's right.

00:08:19.380 --> 00:08:20.630
Over there!

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:23.910
That's...

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:28.130
Let the beauty of the scene entrance you!

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:30.910
And worship me.

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:34.500
I am the beautiful, legendary Magical Farmer,

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:35.430
Yui-sama!

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:37.430
Magical Farmer Yui?

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:38.590
You know her?

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:39.490
Yes.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:40.940
I've heard of a magical farm girl

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:42.630
who's taking over the country,

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:46.070
by turning the entire landmass into a
one hundred percent self-sufficient farm!

00:08:46.070 --> 00:08:48.370
I wonder what her true identity is.

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:51.880
Now, become slaves of the great Yui-sama!

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:55.690
<i>Abramahrikufranpa!</i>

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:58.140
<i>Wheat Harvest, Field
Harvest, Second Harvest!</i>

00:08:58.140 --> 00:08:59.950
<i>Dosse!</i>

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.070
Teacher!

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:03.820
Everyone!

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:08.330
Let's all go and raise some yummy crops.

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:09.500
Okay!

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:10.490
Teacher?

00:09:10.490 --> 00:09:12.360
What about the field trip today?

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:13.920
Field trip?

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:16.300
We're having farm classes instead!

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:19.190
That's awful!

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:22.600
I made far too much fried
egg for my brother!

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:23.290
That's right!

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.180
Are you going to waste my handmade lunch?

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:28.280
And I wore my sexiest underwear,
so that Takuma-kun

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:30.680
would finally eat me!

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:32.900
Here you go.

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:39.890
Hotaru-chan,

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:42.190
no one makes five big boxes
of fried egg for lunch!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:45.040
Hayami-chan, even if you
pour your own water,

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.560
instant ramen is not "homemade"!

00:09:47.530 --> 00:09:49.780
Hamaji-chan, I was surprised
for a minute there,

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:51.680
and to be honest, it was a little tempting!

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:53.790
Takuma-kun!

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:57.940
Thanks to you, the energy is charged,
and I can use magic now!

00:09:57.940 --> 00:09:59.680
What kind of magic?

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:04.770
<i>Magical Magical Overdrive!</i>

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:24.130
Beautiful magical girl Magical Otoha
has beautifully arrived!

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:25.450
I've been waiting for this!

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:26.820
Good luck!

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:31.480
Bad girls who take everyone else's fun
will be punished by my magic.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:32.910
Hah!

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:36.210
Take my organically grown
type-108 farming magic!

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:40.210
I'll start off with my special attack!

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:42.320
<i>First Agricultural Price Crash!</i>

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:43.540
Hah!

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:47.160
<i>Special Move: Post-War Reduction in
Rice Cultivation Policy Dynamic!</i>

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:55.010
My economic bubble's burst!

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:00.100
What was the "magic" part...

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:09.460
Good.

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:11.930
We're a bit closer to the real world.

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:13.510
Thank you, Takuma-kun.

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:14.220
Otoha-chan!

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:16.170
Now let's go on the field trip!

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:19.990
You can eat my special lunch,
onigiri with three candies inside!

00:11:26.150 --> 00:11:29.670
<b>Original Work: Hotaru</b>

00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:30.230
What?

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:32.300
What is this mysterious opening?

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:34.000
If you're remarking on the opening,

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.210
you've gotten better, Takuma-kun.

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:37.310
<b>Planning, Scenario: Otoha</b>

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:40.340
<b>You cried yesterday, didn't you?</b>

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.340
<b>Otoha</b>

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:43.380
<b>Your eyes are a bit swollen.</b>

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:43.280
<b>Hayami     Hamaji     Hotaru     Takuma</b>

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:47.240
<b>The light through the trees is too bright, isn't it?</b>

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:48.990
<b>Everyone Else</b>

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:51.820
<b>Get better soon!</b>

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:52.500
Smiles for you! Magical Otoha!

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:55.690
<b>Here she is!</b>

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:58.060
<b>Magical  O - TO - HA -</b>

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:58.050
Leave it to me!

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:02.030
<b>Sorry to make you wait!</b>

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:04.330
<b>Let's have fun!</b>

00:12:04.350 --> 00:12:11.110
<b>No matter what the wish, with my magic,</b>

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:15.450
<b>I'll make it all come true...</b>

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:19.350
<b>In all the colors of the rainbow!</b>

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:26.260
<b>Magical</b>

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:26.260
<b>Otoha</b>

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.100
O-Oto-Oto...

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:50.680
Brother!

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:51.620
Otoha-neesan!

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:55.230
I knew you'd be here, Sister!

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:56.320
Even if you are his fiancée,

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:58.390
I still think it's too early to sleep together!

00:12:58.390 --> 00:12:59.970
W-W-W-W-Wait!

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:00.830
This is a misunderstanding!

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:02.270
I didn't...

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:05.390
Morning, everyone...

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:06.650
Tacky!

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.100
This is wrong!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.760
Mother will not allow it!

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:12.450
You need to be married first—

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:19.910
I'll go make breakfast...

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:21.750
I'll do the laundry...

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:24.650
I wouldn't have minded, either.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:31.450
I spent my days whacking people with the fan
when they got out of hand.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:34.750
Again! And again! And again...

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:38.200
What's wrong, Takuma-chan?

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:41.020
He's been so tired lately...

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:42.750
I don't know why.

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:45.650
Maybe I've played too much.

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:49.120
No, I want to cheer him up somehow...

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:50.070
Right.

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:54.530
Today is the day I shall turn
the school into a farm,

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:57.500
and put it under my control!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:58.860
<i>Mahrikumaharita.</i>

00:13:58.860 --> 00:14:00.520
<i>Wheat Harvest, Field
Harvest, Second Harv—</i>

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:09.260
Yui-chan! Standing in the
window is dangerous...

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:11.630
Otoha-chan, at least transform first...

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:13.910
Oh, no!

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:15.620
He's getting tired and desperate!

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.270
He can't save the world like this!

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.340
And there's only one way to heal a warrior,

00:14:19.340 --> 00:14:22.210
wounded on the battlefield, isn't there?

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:24.640
I'm back...

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:27.960
Welcome back, master!

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:31.750
Will you have food first?

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:33.480
Or a bath?

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:35.920
Or me...

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:38.620
What's going on, you three?

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:42.660
Uh, you've been tired lately.

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:43.740
So we were wondering

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:45.630
if there were any way we could help...

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:47.540
It's embarrassing, though.

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:49.800
So we're going to serve you!

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.270
Tacky!

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:53.210
Dinner?

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:54.020
A bath?

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:55.090
Or...

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:56.040
Me...

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:06.320
Man... That was a good, clean hit,
if I do say so myself.

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:11.860
It can't be...

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:13.390
But the evil was destroyed!

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:18.500
Hey, Takuma-kun!

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:20.060
O-Otoha-chan?

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:20.700
Why?

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:23.640
I came to serve you, of course!

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:25.000
S-Serve?

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:29.330
A bath together...

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:30.130
No!

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:31.530
There's no room, and I'm naked!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:32.210
It's okay!

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:33.270
I'm in a swimsuit.

00:15:33.270 --> 00:15:35.100
I can feel something pressing against me...

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:36.550
I'm pressing them against you!

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:41.120
You're actually pretty well-built.

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:48.390
I can't go on...

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:51.230
Takuma-kun!

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:58.170
I'm sorry, Takuma-kun...

00:15:58.170 --> 00:16:00.670
I'm okay.

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:05.080
I just wanted you to get better.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:08.380
But I lost control...

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:11.180
It's fine.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:14.860
It's lots of fun.

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:16.340
Fun?

00:16:16.340 --> 00:16:17.760
This world?

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:18.960
Yeah.

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:24.130
It's crazy, but kind and warm and fun.

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:27.630
Just like a certain someone.

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:29.800
Takuma-kun.

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:32.070
But...

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:36.770
You can't forget what's important,
just because it's fun.

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:40.710
I need to stop this.

00:16:40.710 --> 00:16:42.980
Otoha-chan?

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:18.980
<i>I'm saved...</i>

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:22.920
<i>I was able to swim...</i>

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:25.750
Let's go out back.

00:17:27.510 --> 00:17:28.530
Hayami-chan!

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:31.240
Don't do anything!

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:33.560
You can't, anyway.

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:35.960
Wait!

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:39.340
Damn it...

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:47.880
Hayami-chan!

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:51.980
Wait, you jerk!

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:57.250
Hayami-chan!

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:06.060
Otoha-chan... Otoha-chan!

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:10.870
Takuma-kun...

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:12.000
Otoha-chan!

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:15.020
What happened, Otoha-chan?

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:16.240
I'm sorry.

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:19.910
I couldn't win on my own...

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:23.050
Are you one of Magical Otoha's friends?

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:29.090
If I defeat Magical Otoha,
there will be none to oppose me.

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:30.790
You did this to her?

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:35.730
Now the spirit world is mine!

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:38.910
Takuma-kun, take this...

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:39.630
What is it?

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:44.600
Please save the world...

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:47.800
Otoha-chan?

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:49.040
Otoha-chan!

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:06.590
What can you do alone?

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:11.900
I can do it.

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:16.070
If I believe it, I can do anything!

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:17.720
Here I go!

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:36.150
So you don't need to worry anymore.

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:42.460
Yeah. You're right!

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:49.940
So you were the one

00:19:49.940 --> 00:19:52.470
who showed me that world,
after all, Otoha-chan.

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:53.750
I'm sorry.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:56.740
It's like I got you involved in something weird.

00:19:56.740 --> 00:19:59.000
Why are you apologizing?

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:00.980
I had lots of fun,

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:03.310
and I thought you did, too.

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:05.890
It's fine.

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:09.590
You really are nice!

00:20:09.590 --> 00:20:12.260
That's why I love you.

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:16.060
Hey, when did you realize?

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:19.600
The story of the TimeSound Spirit.

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:25.480
Hotaru-chan was so happy that
she'd finally finished it.

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:26.800
I see...

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:28.800
The TimeSound Spirit worries,

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:32.610
to the end, about the
Promised One she left behind.

00:20:32.610 --> 00:20:35.170
Th-There wasn't any magical girl in it, though.

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:39.010
That was an addition to the original work.

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:41.760
But I guess I didn't need to worry.

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.220
The Promised One was fine.

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:49.030
So the TimeSound Spirit can go back,
without worrying.

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:50.190
Are you...

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:52.940
Are you Hinata-chan?

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:56.300
I'm Otoha. Otoha!

00:20:56.830 --> 00:20:58.470
Someone who isn't

00:20:58.470 --> 00:21:02.380
around anymore can't stay bound
by the present forever.

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:15.620
Thank you for finding me...

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:19.120
Thanks to you, I got to see
what I always wanted to see.

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:21.640
I'm happy.

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:24.340
Otoha-chan...

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:26.930
This is for the best.

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:29.720
It's a bit sad,

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:33.910
but I'm not the one you really
should be looking at.

00:21:34.970 --> 00:21:36.270
It's okay.

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:38.880
You can do anything.

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:42.030
Including the future...

00:21:43.010 --> 00:21:44.600
So...

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:47.860
Otoha-chan...

00:21:55.800 --> 00:21:59.160
So, about yesterday's math homework.

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:01.140
Don't worry. It's perfect.

00:22:01.140 --> 00:22:02.290
Really?

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:04.700
There was one I couldn't get.

00:22:04.700 --> 00:22:05.470
Morning!

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:06.290
Morning!

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:07.500
How was it?

00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:09.440
Aw, that's great...

00:22:10.560 --> 00:22:11.980
Hirose-sama!

00:22:13.210 --> 00:22:16.170
You'll be late, Hirose-sama!

00:22:16.170 --> 00:22:18.010
We'll leave you behind, Hirose.

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:21.350
Wait, you two!

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:26.310
<b>Eighth Hour: Otoha</b>

00:24:00.100 --> 00:24:06.260
<b>About H2O</b>

00:24:01.560 --> 00:24:05.260
Now that I'm back to Hotaru,
let's talk about H2O again!

00:24:05.260 --> 00:24:07.540
An "H" Hot-Tempered Old Guy

00:24:07.540 --> 00:24:09.790
In other words, it's really about me!

00:24:09.790 --> 00:24:11.150
I see.

00:24:11.150 --> 00:24:14.300
Is this bullying?

00:24:11.550 --> 00:24:14.930
<b>Ninth Hour: Hozumi</b>
